namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIWidgetLibrary {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary
    src   "Finding widgets, driving a drag, and building an image brush from Blueprint -- the parts of\nUMG's UWidgetBlueprintLibrary that mean something in this framework.\n\nThe parts that do not are named in the parity table with their reasons, and they are all one\nreason: UMG's library is half Slate plumbing. FEventReply, the OnPaint drawing context and the\nSlate input-event structs describe an SWidget's conversation with Slate, and a DreamGUI widget\nnever has that conversation -- its input arrives as a UDreamPointerEventData from the event\nsystem and its pixels come from its own mesh."
    text  "查找控件、驱动拖拽，以及从蓝图构建图像画笔——这些是\nUMG的UWidgetBlueprintLibrary中在本框架里有意义的部分。\n\n不在此列的部分已在功能对照表中连同原因一并列出，而原因全都只有一个：\nUMG的库有一半是Slate的底层管道。FEventReply、OnPaint绘制上下文和\nSlate输入事件结构体描述的是SWidget与Slate之间的对话，而DreamGUI控件\n从不会有这种对话——它的输入以UDreamPointerEventData的形式从事件\n系统到达，像素则来自它自己的网格。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetLibrary:BeginDragWithOperation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:BeginDragWithOperation
    src   "Start a drag on a widget right now, from a pointer that is already pressed on it -- UMG's\nDetectDragIfPressed, minus the \"if pressed\" test, which the caller has already passed by\nhaving a pressed pointer's event data in hand.\n\n@return false when the pointer is not pressed on anything, or is already dragging."
    text  "立即在控件上开始拖拽，使用的指针已经按在该控件上——即UMG的\nDetectDragIfPressed，去掉了“是否按下”的判断，调用方手头已有按下指针的事件数据，\n因而已经通过了这项判断。\n\n@return 当指针没有按在任何对象上，或已经在拖拽时返回false。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetLibrary:CancelDragDrop {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:CancelDragDrop
    src   "End every drag in flight without a drop -- what Escape does. True when there was one to cancel."
    text  "结束所有进行中的拖拽且不放置——即按Escape所做的。存在可取消的拖拽时返回true。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetLibrary:CreateDragDropOperation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:CreateDragDropOperation
    src   "Make a drag operation to hand to a drag that is starting -- UMG's CreateDragDropOperation.\n\nThe operation is what gives a drag MEANING: the payload, a tag for drop targets to filter on,\nand the widget class to show under the cursor. Write it onto the pointer's DragOperation and\nthe drag-drop subsystem takes it from there. UDreamUIDragSource does exactly that for the\ncommon case; this is for a graph that builds the payload itself."
    text  "创建一个拖拽操作，交给即将开始的拖拽——即UMG的CreateDragDropOperation。\n\n该操作赋予拖拽以意义：负载、供放置目标筛选的标签，\n以及要在光标下显示的控件类。将它写入指针的DragOperation，\n拖放子系统便会从那里接手。UDreamUIDragSource对常见情况正是这样做的；\n这里面向的是自行构建负载的图表。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetLibrary:DismissAllMenus {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:DismissAllMenus
    src   "Close every menu anchor that is open, anywhere in this world -- UMG's DismissAllMenus.\n\nWhat a \"go back\", a pause or a scene change needs: a dropdown left open belongs to the screen\nit was opened over, and nothing else knows it is there. Walks the anchors rather than keeping\na registry of open ones, because an anchor closed by any other route would have to remember to\nleave that registry and the one that forgot would leak a phantom.\n\n@return how many were closed, so a caller can tell \"nothing was open\" from \"did nothing\"."
    text  "关闭此世界中任意位置所有已打开的菜单锚点——UMG的DismissAllMenus。\n\n“返回”、暂停或切换场景需要这样做：遗留未关的下拉菜单属于它被打开时所在的\n那个屏幕，除此之外没有谁知道它在那里。这里遍历锚点，而不是维护一份\n已打开锚点的注册表，因为通过其他任何途径关闭的锚点都必须记得\n从该注册表里移除，而忘记移除的那一个会泄漏一个幽灵。\n\n@return 关闭了多少个，这样调用方可以区分“本来就没有打开的”和“什么都没做”。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetLibrary:EqualEqual_DreamUIImageBrush {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:EqualEqual_DreamUIImageBrush
    src   "Are two brushes the same brush? UMG's EqualEqual_SlateBrush, for this framework's brush type."
    text  "两个笔刷是否为同一个笔刷？UMG的EqualEqual_SlateBrush，对应本框架的笔刷类型。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetLibrary:GetAllWidgetsOfClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:GetAllWidgetsOfClass
    src   "Every live widget of a class, anywhere in the world.\n\n@param bTopLevelOnly Only widgets that are the ROOT of their own hierarchy -- a screen page,\n                                             a world-space canvas -- rather than every nested one. UMG's parameter\n                                             means the same thing and is false by default for the same reason: a\n                                             caller looking for \"all the health bars\" wants the nested ones too."
    text  "世界中任意位置某个类的所有存活控件。\n\n@param bTopLevelOnly 仅限自身层级中的根控件——一个屏幕页面、\n                                             一个世界空间画布——而不是每一个嵌套控件。UMG的同名参数\n                                             含义相同，默认也是false，原因也相同：\n                                             寻找“所有血条”的调用方同样需要嵌套的那些。"
    state machine
}

