DreamUIWidgetLibrary:MakeBrushFromAsset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:MakeBrushFromAsset
    src   "An image brush showing whatever the asset is -- a texture, a material, a sprite or an atlas.\n\nOne entry point rather than UMG's separate MakeBrushFromAsset, because the brush stores a bare\nUObject and works out how to draw it; a sprite is the interesting case and UMG has no\nequivalent for it at all."
    text  "显示资产本身内容的图像笔刷——无论是纹理、材质、精灵还是图集。\n\n只有一个入口，而不是UMG那样分开的MakeBrushFromAsset，因为笔刷保存的是裸的\nUObject并自行判断如何绘制；精灵是有意思的情况，UMG对此\n完全没有对应实现。"
    state machine
}

