DreamUIWidgetLibrary:SetFocusToGameViewport {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:SetFocusToGameViewport
    src   "Hand keyboard focus back to the game viewport -- UMG's SetFocusToGameViewport.\n\nThis is a SLATE focus change, not a DreamGUI one: it is what a menu calls on its way out so\nthat the game window starts hearing keys again. UDreamWidget::ClearKeyboardFocus is the\nframework-level counterpart and the two are usually wanted together."
    text  "将键盘焦点交还给游戏视口——UMG的SetFocusToGameViewport。\n\n这是一次SLATE焦点变更，而不是DreamGUI的焦点变更：菜单在退出时会调用它，\n以便游戏窗口重新开始接收按键。框架在控件层面的对应函数是\nUDreamWidget::ClearKeyboardFocus，通常两者需要一起使用。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIWidgetLibrary:SetMousePosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIWidgetLibrary.h#DreamUIWidgetLibrary:SetMousePosition
    src   "Put the cursor somewhere -- UMG's SetMousePosition, minus the FEventReply it was built into.\n\nViewport pixels, the same space GetMousePositionOnViewport reports and the same space a\ngeometry's absolute coordinates are in, so \"warp the cursor to this widget\" is one conversion\nand not two. False when there is no player controller to move it on."
    text  "把光标放到指定位置——即 UMG 的 SetMousePosition，只是去掉了它原本内置的 FEventReply。\n\n单位为视口像素，与 GetMousePositionOnViewport 报告的空间相同，也与\n几何体绝对坐标所在的空间相同，因此“把光标移到这个控件上”只需一次换算，\n而不是两次。若没有可用于移动光标的玩家控制器，则返回 false。"
    state machine
}

